  "run": {
    "final_text": "I added a v2.4.0 section to the top of `RELEASE_NOTES.md`, written in the same style as the earlier entries:\n\n```\nv2.4.0 - 2026-10-20\n  * CSV exporter for the report command (ACME-412)\n  * Retry uploads on 503 errors with backoff (ACME-415)\n  * Fix crash when the config file is empty (ACME-419)\n  * Fix wrong totals in the monthly summary for leap years (ACME-423)\n```\n\n- **Version and date:** I took these from the `VERSION` and `RELEASE_DATE` files.\n- **ACME-421 left out:** That entry was the breaking change (removing the `--legacy` flag from sync, marked `!`). Because it was reverted, the flag still exists, so there's nothing to tell users about upgrading.\n- **No contributor names:** The earlier entries don't credit authors, so I didn't either. I can add the @handles if you want them.",
